      "Irancell gateway failure mode FLIPPED from DROP (7 consecutive passes, i/o timeout) to RST (connection refused) — active control-plane reconfiguration at TIC/DCI whitelister cluster, not infrastructure failure; RST indicates explicit TCP reject policy change vs passive drop",
